#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:7 39d8f0848e4248cabbe3a77968890e5c
#: 61d849063c164d65a56075e1f29b6a0e 9e478b6532d048d5b958a6878ed6a6ca
#: b7b3b9c675e94889a240b95b1485e282 dbbcb79a7f3f4a8e80baccb893fcfc61
msgid "ESC Signalling Issues"
msgstr "ESC 信号问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:9 56f455f973b74f8e9b9b177bce6d9932
#: c4ba235683c54e4792365443b59fc6c0 cbf4b3fa1cb742bf8151898a63281654
#: ecdc64390f744c62ac2bf0b5cc825aee ff62a6246e1c4b4796042cc186dcf056
msgid ""
"This page discusses several potential issues with ESC signaling that can "
"result in unreliable operation or even crashes on takeoff. These primarily "
"occur with larger QuadPlanes that have long runs to their ESCS from power "
"and the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"本页讨论 ESC 信号传输中几个可能导致操作不可靠甚至起飞时坠机的潜在问题。这些问题主要出现在大型 QuadPlane 上，因为其 ESC "
"与电源及飞控之间的走线较长。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:13 084a4de2c4d14a4b9585a39e80395cd9
#: 63766413ab4f4a2b921dfdfcf6bcf3d8 8ed91d8f9dd7436e856a16ff662e497c
#: a8b1d21162e54f05acdc09e8d42bb7c6 ba9c60b91f9049a6b6f2cc9a9e290abd
msgid "Inadequate Signaling Level"
msgstr "信号电平不足"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:15 3acaf339e09248adad3f7e0e6b4efd8d
#: 76ff6e32f8d2485bba645cee4a6096f0 8eac06c8f6c14d16a69af2487454d3de
#: b4e18cdc474b4e84a86ade3bc80cbc4b b83e6eb8738d4edaa84bc56ba1492c62
msgid ""
"Most autopilots use TTL/CMOS compatible signaling on their outputs, but "
"usually only at 3.3V levels. This can ultimately result in poor signaling "
"waveforms or levels at the ESC, resulting in unreliable operation. "
"Contributing factors to that are:"
msgstr ""
"大多数飞控的输出端使用 TTL/CMOS 兼容信号，但通常仅为 3.3V 电平。这最终可能导致 ESC "
"端信号波形或电平较差，从而导致操作不可靠。影响因素包括："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:17 05dcfd2d64e54e99a9362a38840066ea
#: 230949ebc7464df9a639d84757395ae0 46677c3466154c60b5017d13bc3ca0c9
#: 5327ae9d46fb4500ba3f04ba0f2433cc b25e26fa5cd5492e9027ea18d4891a07
msgid "High impedance (either resistive or reactive) wiring runs"
msgstr "高阻抗（阻性或感性）走线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:18 252cb299f7a14b90932a123c7d9878d5
#: 94c5b82f315746f1a4a1a87c52030d18 a054a0e3a1234b868b58ad21654dac00
#: bf632dd7193843fc983fab08618aa600 e9b8aab540844767a96589ae33f83b52
msgid "ESC input loading is too heavy"
msgstr "ESC 输入负载过重"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:20 12f43a21bf2547599caede39450ef623
#: 44ab5356fc0942b49f58ca939a16015f a1dcc7090ac34a5da66bf41575ed83d5
#: e44cf7b3dab24e94a747bd5bace2c56f f8e56e1d67844511ad6323df017c4020
msgid ""
"For large, high-value vehicles, its always good to check the ESC signal "
"levels for each ESC with a scope to assure clean signaling. This is best "
"done with a ground runup to at least 70% throttle, either physically "
"securing the vehicle or mounting its props reversed temporarily."
msgstr ""
"对于大型、高价值的飞行器，建议用示波器检查每个 ESC 的信号电平，以确保信号清晰。最好在地面以至少 70% "
"油门进行测试，同时将飞行器固定或临时反向安装螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:22 4f3d4a0a66d44363a85cac869bae8957
#: 696e25e62c954162bcb30212eb89a379 922179abe1d843f482488713ecba1eba
#: caf3df2f698a430989072acc6b5ed536 d8a9b67141f242a5b1325ef58c02095c
msgid ""
"Below is an example scope trace for two ESC signals for ESCs presenting too "
"high an input load or too much wiring resistance. As shown, the second ESC's"
" analog level is about 3V, which is a little marginal, but the first ESC "
"trace is only about 2V and is too low for reliable operation."
msgstr ""
"以下是两个 ESC 信号的示波器波形示例，这两个 ESC 的输入负载过高或走线电阻过大。如图所示，第二个 ESC 的模拟电平约为 "
"3V，略显边缘，而第一个 ESC 的波形仅约 2V，对于可靠操作来说过低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:27 31f505f45d00419eb6f7ecb747a480ea
#: 4dccbba571824abab790bb4353427f77 b637790f140d4db38aac9ff4b7959521
#: e0b0d4a77c49447984461947762032c7 e46d9aef8dca4bd488b1fc54a19980ce
msgid ""
"It is also possible to see poor rise and fall times, but with adequate "
"voltage levels due to high reactance in the connection. This will also "
"affect timing and performance and should be corrected."
msgstr "由于连接线的高感抗，还可能出现上升沿和下降沿时间较慢但电压电平尚可的情况。这同样会影响时序和性能，需要加以纠正。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:30 4279bb9830b242fda4c3e7b77e136908
#: 45363a0b09ea4c168afd60e2d55dc94b a3c8744ff5e14af7a78b215859245019
#: bec2471275ef4120b694b80c10a86af5 dbeaecba0224408396371ef4e9eb1eca
msgid "Possible Solutions:"
msgstr "可能的解决方案："

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:32 0e838c05d711402ea90c858c8882e2bc
#: 3dabd70ed89543ccb70150bd3d3af86b 75717a507524444697cb516544f99c42
#: 77e20248c5bb4cc982023f2ef88829f1 e708046b07394176a48c8ba2105c0066
msgid "lower wiring impedance with larger wiring or shorter runs"
msgstr "使用更粗的导线或缩短走线长度以降低走线阻抗"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:33 21c8369b79fb41a5a5f0c323f2d5a9d3
#: 2ef8839ab609404c823b77bada97c212 448ea9203fd94fc3af39afac784a922d
#: 7c660e3f7ca445298b374de0b99e0593 fd90be6fc4bf43ad9b6750f5136ebeef
msgid "use ESCs that do not present such high input loading"
msgstr "使用输入负载不那么重的 ESC"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:34 072cca8389a948b5819249c5f59cd2cb
#: 6b7d91d0be8b46bd93c6ed0f8c35a3fc c74219ab28aa4948b74d7eed1f788bfe
#: d2227de477734df5984bc567eea9d174 e71d006955fb46eba9c98413e1b31251
msgid ""
"add buffers to autopilot outputs to provide 5v signaling and higher drive "
"currents"
msgstr "在飞控输出端添加缓冲器，以提供 5V 信号和更高的驱动电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esc-issues.rst:35 00043fa9f924459b9cc3ce5d295de4a0
